---
description: Keep source code and architecture diagram synchronized.
alwaysApply: true
---

Before implementing architectural changes:

1. Read docs/architecture.mmd.
2. Identify which component is being modified.
3. Preserve existing component boundaries unless necessary.
4. If components, interfaces, dependencies, tools, skills,
   agents, databases, or data flows change,
   update docs/architecture.mmd.
5. Use Mermaid MCP to validate and render the updated diagram.
6. Explain what part of the architecture changed.
